{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48002","headline":"空馆夜歌 三 · 夷陵女郎","name":"空馆夜歌 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"[玉]户金缸，愿陪君王。\n邯郸宫中，金石丝簧。\n卫女秦娥，左右成行。\n纨缟缤纷，翠眉红妆。\n王欢顾盼，爲王歌舞。\n愿得君欢，常无灾苦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"夷陵女郎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}